{"id": "pdf_268cda_Session 20-Additive ", "dimension": "pdf_curriculum_qa", "score": 0.0, "all_passed": false, "error": null, "text": "**培训手册信息：**  \n- 文件名：`Session 20-Additive module.pdf`  \n- 所属模块：`verification`  \n- 示例项目：`session_20_additive_module.vcproject`  \n\n**实训目标：**  \n1. 熟悉 Vericut Additive 模块的用户界面与布局；  \n2. 了解 Additive 模块如何在仿真中处理增材制造（3D 打印）过程；  \n3. 掌握在 Vericut 中配置与运行增材制造仿真，包括材料堆积、支撑结构生成及后处理。  \n\n**界面操作主线：**  \n1. 启动 Vericut 并打开项目 `session_20_additive_module.vcproject`；  \n2. 熟悉 Additive 模块的工具栏与面板布局（Workpiece、Tool Library、Process Monitor、In the Project Tree, select Additive > Setup…）。  \n3. 在 Workpiece 视窗中，点击 Play 按钮，观察仿真运行情况。", "criteria_details": [{"key": "literal_all", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 4.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['Define', 'stock']"}], "elapsed_s": 9.826, "completion_tokens": 227, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_layers": {"model": "sha256:4f2f8dd5a2860ee2d28c14718c90afcfbd788efcb3caa5017a20fe3cb761f4da", "model_bytes": 4614301728, "template": "sha256:2f7055ebdd3fdb524063dfe0f46cd93f085d302822e290717f1aeaaaef45e620", "template_bytes": 1784, "system": "sha256:2f4e97d791de80426c7bc8b33f8b9dbb6c70f18d87f8beba5da74cfb8f155161", "system_bytes": 380, "parameters": "sha256:f1eef96f6317330e8d9ee9ab405d8b88ecb8197936b59313edc151cbf097e479", "parameters_bytes": 127, "manifest_digest": "sha256:6553c1ef955b37c76202f8b233b7225d4dbd799042ea03145995181af69ad32f"}}
{"id": "pdf_32c76a_Session 16L-Day 2 Re", "dimension": "pdf_curriculum_qa", "score": 0.0, "all_passed": false, "error": null, "text": "```json\r\n{\n  \"training_session\": \"Session 16L - Day 2 Review Session\",\n  \"module\": \"verification\",\n  \"objective\": \"Review and validate the simulation settings, models, and validation criteria for the project lathe_session_16l_day_2_review.vcproject. Confirm that all simulation components are correctly configured and ready for execution.\",\n  \"interface_operations\": [\n    {\n      \"step\": \"1\",\n      \"action\": \"Open the project file lathe_session_16l_day_2_review.vcproject in Vericut 9.6.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": \"2\",\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup > Model and verify that all models (stock, tools, and NC Program) are correctly loaded and visible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": \"3\",\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup > Component and confirm that all components are set to use the default settings.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": \"4\",\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup > Simulation and review the simulation settings such as Units, Work Offset, and Gage Point configuration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": \"5\",\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup > Validate and confirm that all validation criteria (such as tool length and position tolerances) are set to pass/fail thresholds.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": \"6\",\n      \"action\": \"Click the Play button in the toolbar to run the simulation and observe the Vericut 9.6 status bar for real-time feedback.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "criteria_details": [{"key": "literal_all", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 4.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "missing=['Load', 'Stock']"}], "elapsed_s": 15.168, "completion_tokens": 348, "finish_reason": "stop", "served_layers": {"model": "sha256:4f2f8dd5a2860ee2d28c14718c90afcfbd788efcb3caa5017a20fe3cb761f4da", "model_bytes": 4614301728, "template": "sha256:2f7055ebdd3fdb524063dfe0f46cd93f085d302822e290717f1aeaaaef45e620", "template_bytes": 1784, "system": "sha256:2f4e97d791de80426c7bc8b33f8b9dbb6c70f18d87f8beba5da74cfb8f155161", "system_bytes": 380, "parameters": "sha256:f1eef96f6317330e8d9ee9ab405d8b88ecb8197936b59313edc151cbf097e479", "parameters_bytes": 127, "manifest_digest": "sha256:6553c1ef955b37c76202f8b233b7225d4dbd799042ea03145995181af69ad32f"}}
{"id": "pdf_5aa26c_Session 15M-Cut Stoc", "dimension": "pdf_curriculum_qa", "score": 100.0, "all_passed": true, "error": null, "text": "```json\r\n{\n  \"training_session\": \"Session 15M: Cut Stock Transition between Setups\",\n  \"module\": \"verification\",\n  \"project_example\": \"mill_session_15m_multiple_setups_simulation.vcproject\",\n  \"training_objectives\": [\n    \"Understand how Vericut can help you simulate a cut stock transitioning between setups.\",\n    \"Learn how to use the Setup Browser to manage multiple setups and their associated NC programs.\",\n    \"Practice setting up a simulation with multiple setups and transitioning between them.\"\n  ],\n  \"ui_operations\": [\n    {\n      \"step\": 1,\n      \"action\": \"Open the project file mill_session_15m_multiple_setups_simulation.vcproject.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 2,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 1 and then right-click to rename it to 'Blank Stock'.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 3,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 2 and then right-click to rename it to 'First Setup'.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 4,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 3 and then right-click to rename it to 'Second Setup'.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 5,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 1 and then click on the Configure tab. In the Configure group, select Configure Stock.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 6,\n      \"action\": \"In the Configure Stock dialog, set the Stock Type to 'Blank Cylinder' with a Diameter of 4.000 inch and a Length of 1.000 inch. Click OK.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 7,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 2 and then click on the Configure tab. In the Configure group, select Configure Stock.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 8,\n      \"action\": \"In the Configure Stock dialog, set the Stock Type to 'Blank Cylinder' with a Diameter of 4.000 inch and a Length of 1.000 inch. Click OK.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": 9,\n      \"action\": \"In the Project tree, select Setup 3 and then click on the Configure tab. In the Configure group, select Configure Stock.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step\": ", "criteria_details": [{"key": "literal_all", "type": "literal_all", "weight": 4.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "all present (3)"}], "elapsed_s": 22.552, "completion_tokens": 512, "finish_reason": "length", "served_layers": {"model": "sha256:4f2f8dd5a2860ee2d28c14718c90afcfbd788efcb3caa5017a20fe3cb761f4da", "model_bytes": 4614301728, "template": "sha256:2f7055ebdd3fdb524063dfe0f46cd93f085d302822e290717f1aeaaaef45e620", "template_bytes": 1784, "system": "sha256:2f4e97d791de80426c7bc8b33f8b9dbb6c70f18d87f8beba5da74cfb8f155161", "system_bytes": 380, "parameters": "sha256:f1eef96f6317330e8d9ee9ab405d8b88ecb8197936b59313edc151cbf097e479", "parameters_bytes": 127, "manifest_digest": "sha256:6553c1ef955b37c76202f8b233b7225d4dbd799042ea03145995181af69ad32f"}}
